note = "Info about Google sets
https://github.com/googlefonts/gftools/tree/master/Lib/gftools/encodings/GF%20Glyph%20Sets


Contributing
https://github.com/google/fonts/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md


Checks:

- gf-glyph-scripts - decomposed transformed components



Future
- Add Bitcoin?



About nested components
- in order to avoid issues with variable font I have replaced any glyph with nested components (i.e. Ohornacute, etc) with just the components.


1.011

- Added Kaisymbol
- Added Tabular Figures and Tabular math symbols
- Amended the Greek Opentype fix. (Added accented uppercase calts and fixed the OT code)
- Added arrows";
